OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAn isolated light shower is
OL,6,Fpossible on Monday, especially in the
OL,7,Fmorning. Most areas will have a fine
OL,8,Fday though with variable amounts of
OL,9,Fcloud and bright spells. Warm in the
OL,10,Fsunshine.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FMostly dry overnight with
OL,13,Fclear spells. Variable amounts of
OL,14,Fcloud and light winds for all. A few
OL,15,Ffog patches possible.
OL,16,
OL,17,CTuesday:FA bright start for many but
OL,18,Fincreasing amounts of cloud across the
OL,19,Fnorth of the region during the
OL,20,Fmorning. Feeling very warm in the
OL,21,Fsunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
