OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,6,FRemaining settled over the coming days
OL,7,Fwith plenty of sunshine. Very warm,
OL,8,Fwith temperatures rising further and
OL,9,Fbecoming hot locally by Wednesday.
OL,10,FCooler and less settled from Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
